      ":question/id": "d5256ff3-852c-5b98-9d63-d4d7090453ce",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-6x-6y &=-3 \\\\ 4x+5y &=6 \\\\ -8x-8y &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-6 & -6 & -3 \\\\ 4 & 5 & 6 \\\\ -8 & -8 & -1\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-6 & -6 & -3 \\\\ 4 & 5 & 6 \\\\ -8 & -8 & -1\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{1}:=\\frac{1}{3}{R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 4 & 5 & 6 \\\\ -8 & -8 & -1\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(2){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 4 \\\\ -8 & -8 & -1\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-4){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2}:=-1{R}_{2} \\\\ & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nA row corresponds to the equation $0x+0y=3,$ and this has no solution. Therefore, our system has no solution, and we conclude that the system is inconsistent.\n\nAs a result, select: The system is inconsistent.",
